## 🎯 What I Learned
- Formatted text using HTML tags.
- Understood the difference between visual tags (`<b>`, `<i>`) and semantic tags (`<strong>`, `<em>`).
- Highlighted, deleted, and inserted text.
- Displayed scientific formulas and mathematical expressions using subscript and superscript tags.

